# c05-playing-reload: section 7 C05 (H4) - Playing is preserved and the third frame is 750/250/0
exit ok
frame 250/250/0
frame 500/250/0
frame 750/250/0
count tickAttempts 3
count suppressedTicks 0
count emittedTickFrames 3
count publicUpdateAttempts 3
count publicUpdateSuccesses 3
count frameCount 3
require-count host.reload-sample 1
require host.command index=3 line=5 verb=reload outcome=ok transport=Playing->Playing
# NOTE (source line numbers): the task table spelled this as line=4 by counting the program
# without the header comment that names the case. The reload is source line 5.
# NOTE (runner): the case runner truncates this require to "host.command".
